      "writtenOn": "2022-10-19T10:46:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure I understood. We do that in aosp/2260582, the problem is aosp/2259705 that unconditionally adds com.android.virt-bootclasspath-fragment to platform_bootclasspath. I wasn\u0027t able to find an easy way to conditionally append to the fragments list there, hence this change",
