      "writtenOn": "2022-10-19T12:22:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Probably, but I\u0027d prefer to do it in a separate change. There is already a precedent for removing the JAR from the list (the android.car-module one above), my version is just a tad more robust, since it will catch the scenario when product has AVF, but doesn\u0027t have the android.system.virtualmachine JAR in PRODUCT_APEX_BOOT_JARS",
